      "text": "\"Den\" means \"it\" for words like nøkkelen and veska. \"Min\" and \"di\" are again the little words that come after the noun: nøkkelen min, veska di. A feminine word like veska takes \"mi\" and \"di\", a masculine word like nøkkelen takes \"min\" and \"din\". \"Jeg vet ikke\" is \"I don't know\".",
